     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\sqrt {773} \"></span></p>\n<p>773 is a prime number, so this cannot be further simplified.</p>\n<p>The rational part is 1. (You can always have a factor of 1.)</p>\n<p>The irrational part is <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {15} \"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\sqrt {733}\">\\sqrt {733}</span>. The rational part is 1, and the irrational part is <span data-math=\"\\sqrt {733} \">\\sqrt {733}</span>."
    }
   ],
